            "review_title": "Review at Local Bar",
            "review_text": "The Gypsy Club\nFloriana, Malta367 contributions\n0\nA tight squeeze!\nNov 2016 • Friends\nIf this is the same 'Local' bar that on the popular street in Hoan Kiem district, then yes, it's an alright place. Quite small so gets packed and crammed quite quickly. Current commercial music and decent drink prices at the bar. The only annoying thing is that they advertise and sell those ridiculous helium-laced balloons to inhale during your visit. Very, VERY tacky and outright dangerous. To be fair to them however, most other places are also selling them.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten November 14, 2016",
